WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.750
Answer "Tell me about yourself". Build a concise professional story that connects what you do now, your proof, and why this role fits.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.500
Part 1. Start in the present. State what you do, the problems you handle, and the strength you want them to remember.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Part 2. Add relevant proof. Choose one past example that supports the work this team needs you to do.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.000
Part 3. Connect to this role. Explain why the position is a sensible next step, not simply an available opening.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.750
Part 4. Keep it focused. Aim for about sixty to ninety seconds and leave room for the interviewer to follow up.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.500
Practice line. Present, proof, purpose. Use those three beats to stay natural without memorizing every word.
